{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Begin to possess (החל רש).</b> From the language of ירושה (taking possession as an inheritance). And our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: החל רש — 'I have made his land חולין (free/open) before you.' And the intention of this is that Ammon and Moab were cleared through Sihon, and from now on it is permitted for them to conquer the land, for it belongs to Sihon."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:44:52.460371410Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}